stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Scheduled: Learner Books Session\n(Deducts 1 Coin with Idempotency Key)

    Scheduled --> InProgress: Mentor / Learner Joins Workspace\n(Generates Jitsi Room & Starts Clock)
    Scheduled --> Cancelled: Cancelled by Mentor / Learner\n(Full Coin Refund Issued)
    Scheduled --> Cancelled: Admin Intervention\n(Administrative Cancellation + Refund)

    InProgress --> Completed: Both Parties Complete & Confirm\n(Transfers 1 Coin to Mentor Wallet)
    InProgress --> Cancelled: Emergency Termination\n(Investigated via Moderation Queue)

    Completed --> FeedbackSubmitted: Either Party Submits Review\n(1-5 Stars + Feedback Text)
    FeedbackSubmitted --> [*]: Updates Mentor Credibility Score\n& Records Learning Activity

    Cancelled --> [*]: Slot Restored & Notifications Dispatched
